      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so you're saying 10,555,889 is a \"moderate risk\"? i thought if they already have a layered carbon-ceramic composite for electronics, our graphene one might basically be a direct overlap. \n\nbe real with me—if we walk into this pitch saying our IP is solid, and an investor brings up that specific patent, are we just dead in the water? how much of a problem are we actually looking at here? be blunt.",
      "source": "evaluator"
